  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'd love to see a feature in the Virtual Creator Companion that allows for custom sorting or pinning of packages in the \"Manage Packages\" list. As someone who works in Unity daily and juggles multiple avatars and setups, it would be super helpful to:\n\nPin frequently used packages to the top\n\nSee recently used/imported packages first\n\nGroup or tag packages based on personal workflow\n\nRight now the list is static and grows quickly with community tools, which makes navigating it a bit slow. Custom sorting (drag-and-drop or favorites) would make a huge difference in efficiency.\n\nThanks!!!",
